values ('K140', 'Can caregivers give medications?', 'Caregivers can remind about medicines, read the label, and hand over or open the container. They cannot give or set out any medicine, fill a pill organizer, apply creams or drops, or check blood sugar. A family member or another responsible person can fill the pill organizer, and our office can help find a solution for anything beyond that.', 'medications', 'S8', array['medication','medicine','pills','pill organizer']::text[], array['Can a caregiver give Mom her pills?','Can caregivers fill a pill organizer?','Can a caregiver check blood sugar?','Do you help with medicine?']::text[], array[]::text[], array[]::text[], 'verified', 'public', 95, false, '2026-11-06', 'Samantha approved 11-06 (from mo-care.com, Client Care Agreement, Client Handbook)', 'na', 'na', 'ok', 1)
